{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "CGDCX4KSGMMGFWO5YVIW5BO53ZGHWTHD",
    "type": "home",
    "storyId": "00001021118002",
    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "アルヴ、少し時間はあるか？\nよければ、一緒にカフェに行かないか。",
            "enText": "Arve, do you have a moment? \nIf it's alright with you, I'd like you \nto accompany me for coffee.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 4145096708239493392,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……なぜ私と？",
            "enText": "…Why me?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 2421710346030809631,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "貴方と一緒に行きたい人はたくさん\nいるはずです。その人たちに頼めば……。",
            "enText": "Surely many others would be glad to \naccompany you, why not ask them…?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -5465654259167238615,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "いや、お前の行きつけのカフェが\n気になっているんだ。どうか\n案内してはくれないだろうか。",
            "enText": "Well, I'm curious about that café \nyou frequent. I was hoping you'd \nbe willing to take me along.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 1973902884842245478,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "あの店の自慢は確か……\nオーガニックブレンドだったか？",
            "enText": "If I'm not mistaken, their selling point is… \ntheir organic blend?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 5648824196239516697,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "え？　ええ……\n深煎りのオーガニックです。",
            "enText": "Huh? Uh… yes, it's an organic dark roast.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 6971433477616977316,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "一杯ずつ、ハンドドリップで入れてくれます。\n……時間をかけて。",
            "enText": "They take their time to hand brew \nthe coffee… nice and slow.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -4101494284890317036,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "ほう、それはいい。\n確か、ケーキも色々置いているのだったな。\nコーヒーに合わせて選ぶのは楽しそうだ。",
            "enText": "Hmm, now that sounds great. I believe they \nhave a varied selection of cakes as well? \nPicking some to match the coffee will be a joy.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 5598685884366952044,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "なにしろ――\n今日は、お前の誕生日だからな。",
            "enText": "Today is, after all, your birthday.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 4636420506396215700,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……、そういう――",
            "enText": "…I don't ——",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -1973818206674438351,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "早くしないと、ケーキが売り切れて\nしまうかもしれないな。さあ行こう。",
            "enText": "We should hurry, before the cakes sell out. \nCome on, lead the way.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 2384117731997013054,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "――…………。",
            "enText": "……",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 8898614693882983447,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……フランボワーズのケーキは、\nすぐ売り切れてしまうんです。\n行くなら――早く行きましょう。",
            "enText": "…The raspberry cake does sell out \nalmost immediately. …Follow me, then.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "pathId": -1092355816596169823,
            "blockIdx": 13
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1777642649,
    "humanTl": true
}